  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> (cm) là cạnh góc vuông của tấm gỗ hình tam giác vuông cắt được, khi đó cạnh huyền là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (cm) (với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>\n\t\tCạnh góc vuông còn lại là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>240</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDiện tích của tam giác vuông là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>240</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>240</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/658337aa376594bf590739ee0302aad55aa644e9c21d944818688c8df79140b7.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTừ đó suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>max</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1600</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tCạnh huyền của tấm gỗ là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cm).",
